# flow_driver sidecars — machine-local generation state, never source.
# .size marks a still that came back sub-2K (upscaler down); v2_prompt._below_2k
# reads it (and the JPEG header) to re-pull on the next lap. .FAILED.txt is a
# leftover from the retired 1K-fallback era; nothing reads it anymore.
*.size
*.FAILED.txt
STASH-INDEX.json

# publish_ledger.py sha1 cache — machine-local (mtimes differ per machine)
.hash-cache.json
